# stage-5 fidelity: FROZEN-FORMAT relaxation diagnostics (ref/fidelity_check.py --diag)
# Each config RELAXES one frozen fixed-point limit (NOT RTL-legal) and re-runs the
# end-to-end teacher-forced metric at res_scale=8, to say which RTL change would
# actually be worth un-freezing.  Reference points: float-exact 24/24 top1,
# float-with-W4-weights 12/24, shipped fixed point 0-1/24.
#   gateport : dt_bias/A gate ports unbounded (audit finding (c) removed)
#   S_F12/11 : DeltaNet state at Q3.12 / Q4.11 instead of Q2.13
#   all      : gateport + S_F12
#   dn_o*n*  : the two SCRIPT-SIDE DeltaNet output-alignment immediates
#              (DN_O_SHIFT, DN_NORM_F) -- these ARE RTL-legal, and all of
#              them are WORSE than the shipped 5 / 8

